> > > This part concerns me. It seems to me that devices supporting
> > > "uncombinable" effects are in fact not memoryless devices and we =
should
> > > not be introducing this term here. If the goal is to work around =
limited
> > > number of effect slots in the devices by combining certain effect=
s then
> > > it needs to be done at ff-core level as it will be potentially us=
eful
> > > for all devices.
> >=20
